  "details": "Please allow a friend to be added to more than one list. Depending on how you decide to organize, it makes sense for a person who is perhaps part of more than one friend group. Or perhaps if you do it by priority then someone might be in your closest circle without excluding and therefore hiding them from other lists. \n\nFor a personal example I have a list of close friends, and then a list of closest friends. I have the list of close friends on my wing menu, but this completely hides all the people in the closest friends list, unless I press the arrow to scroll over, which then obscures all the people in the other list.",
